{"result":"ok","response":"collection","data":[{"id":"334019e1-18bb-4ac0-b35c-0e8efb1e481c","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken Dai-9-bu: The JOJOLands Color-ban"},"altTitles":[{"en":"JoJo\u2019s Bizarre Adventure, Part 9: The JoJoLands - Digital Colored Comics"},{"ja":"\u30b8\u30e7\u30b8\u30e7\u306e\u5947\u5999\u306a\u5192\u967a \u7b2c9\u90e8 \u30b6\u30fb\u30b8\u30e7\u30b8\u30e7\u30e9\u30f3\u30ba \u30ab\u30e9\u30fc\u7248"},{"en":"JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken Part 9: The JoJoLands (Official Colored)"},{"en":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure, Part 9: The JOJOLands (Official Colored)"},{"en":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure, Part 9: The JOJOLands (Official Colored)"}],"description":{"en":"The ninth story arc of JoJo\u2019s Bizarre Adventure.\n\nO\u2019ahu, early 2020s. Dua Lipa is a trending musician, and COVID is still a major concern. On this island lives a 15-year-old boy named Jodio Joestar. Alongside his sibling, Dragona Joestar, they act as dealers for certain illegal substances. One day, their employer comes and shows them an excellent find: a Japanese person has landed in Hawaii with a diamond worth over six million dollars. Normally it would be impossible to steal, but for two siblings with Stands\u2026\n\nThis is a story of a young boy and his quest to become rich."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"bw":"series\/457166\/list","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0CMCGL843\/","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/803506\/","mal":"139629","raw":"https:\/\/www.shueisha.co.jp\/books\/search\/search.html?seriesid=107241"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":null,"lastChapter":null,"publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2023,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"320831a8-4026-470b-94f6-8353740e6f04","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Official Colored"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes