"en","it","vi","es-la"],"latestUploadedChapter":"f2a86e62-3adf-4c4e-b169-61b970e40a3f"},"relationships":[{"id":"1e77215f-d4c2-4c42-99dc-7a19ae4f988e","type":"author"},{"id":"db7a92e1-614a-4db9-97f1-f692b7ecba8b","type":"author"},{"id":"e1a32bf1-24bf-466a-800d-61b02a0519ee","type":"artist"},{"id":"8736a959-fd0b-4fea-a60e-83fcddc01307","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"4","fileName":"66e58183-b0dc-4500-b74d-8cae5e262837.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2021-05-23T08:07:41+00:00","updatedAt":"2021-05-23T08:07:41+00:00","version":2}},{"id":"a1f9462a-a340-4098-81de-1f2536b2f782","type":"manga","related":"alternate_story"}]},{"id":"89ed3ec2-ebe6-4d6b-92eb-d753a8bb365e","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Rougo ni Sonaete Isekai de 8-manmai no Kinka wo Tamemasu"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u8001\u5f8c\u306b\u5099\u3048\u3066\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u30678\u4e07\u679a\u306e\u91d1\u8ca8\u3092\u8caf\u3081\u307e\u3059"},{"ja-ro":"Rougo ni Sonaete Isekai de 8-manmai no Kinka o Tamemasu"},{"en":"Saving 80,000 Gold in Another World for My Retirement"},{"en":"Saving 80,000 Gold Coins in the Different World for My Old Age"},{"ko":"\ub178\ud6c4\ub97c \ub300\ube44\ud574 \uc774\uc138\uacc4\uc5d0\uc11c \uae08\ud654 8\ub9cc \uac1c\ub97c \ubaa8\uc74d\ub2c8\ub2e4"},{"zh":"\u4e3a\u4e86\u517b\u8001\u91d1\uff0c\u53bb\u5f02\u754c\u5b58\u516b\u4e07\u91d1\uff01"},{"zh-hk":"\u70ba\u4e86\u990a\u8001\u91d1\uff0c\u53bb\u7570\u754c\u5b58\u516b\u842c\u91d1\uff01"},{"fr":"\u00c9conomiser 80,000 pi\u00e8ces d'or dans un autre monde pour ma retraite"},{"ru":"\u0421\u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 80 000 \u0437\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0442\u044b\u0445 \u043c\u043e\u043d\u0435\u0442 \u0432 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u043e\u043c \u043c\u0438\u0440\u0435 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043c\u043e\u0435\u0439 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438"},{"es":"Ahorre 80 000 monedas de oro en otro mundo en preparaci\u00f3n para mi jubilaci\u00f3n"},{"vi":"Ti\u1ebft Ki\u1ec7m 80.000 V\u00e0ng \u1ede Th\u1ebf Gi\u1edbi Kh\u00e1c Cho Tu\u1ed5i Gi\u00e0 C\u1ee7a T\u00f4i"}],"description":{"en":"After growing up an orphan, Mitsuha has a healthy respect for money and a desire to live well\u2014at least, until she dies after being pushed off a cliff. Waking up in a strange fantasy world, Mitsuha narrowly survives an encounter with a pack of wolves, then realizes she has the power to move between this world and the real one. A lesser person might embark on heroic adventures\u2014Mitsuha instead immediately recognizes the lucrative possibilities of her new situation, and heads out to buy an arsenal of modern weapons. Her goal: to acquire 80,000 gold, and the life of leisure she's always dreamed of!\n\n---\nNote: The English language translation has a different numbering as they group short chapters together into one chapter.","ja":"\u5c71\u91ce\u30df\u30c4\u30cf\u306f18\u6b73\u3067\u3042\u308a\u306a\u304c\u3089\u4e2d\u5b66\u751f\u306b\u898b\u3089\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u7ae5\u9854\u5c0f\u67c4\u306a\u5c11\u5973\u3002\u9ad8\u6821\u5352\u696d\u3092\u76ee\u524d\u306b\u3057\u3066\u4e21\u89aa\u3068\u983c\u308c\u308b\u5144\u3092\u4e00\u5ea6\u306b\u5931\u3044\u3001\u3044\u304d\u306a\u308a\u5929\u6daf\u5b64\u72ec\u306e\u8eab\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u3002\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30af\u3067\u5927\u5b66\u53d7\u9a13\u306b\u3082\u5931\u6557\u3057\u3066\u9014\u65b9\u306b\u66ae\u308c\u3066\u3044\u305f\u30df\u30c4\u30cf\u306f\u3001\u305f\u307e\u305f\u307e\u8b0e\u306e\u5b58\u5728\u304b\u3089\u300c\u4e16\u754c\u9593\u8ee2\u79fb\u300d\u3068\u3044\u3046\u80fd\u529b\u3092\u4e0e\u3048\u3089\u308c\u308b\u3002\u305d\u3053\u304b\u3089\u5f7c\u5973\u304c\u601d\u3044\u3064\u3044\u305f\u5c06\u6765\u8a2d\u8a08\u306f\u3001\u4e16\u9593\u4e00\u822c\u306e\u5e38\u8b58\u306e\u659c\u3081\u4e0a\u3092\u3044\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305f\u2500\u2500!!","pt-br":"Uma garota de 18 anos que perdeu sua fam\u00edlia em um acidente, Yamano Mitsuha cai de um penhasco em um dia qualquer e \u00e9 transportada para um mundo diferente com uma civiliza\u00e7\u00e3o ao n\u00edvel da Europa Medieval. Mitsuha descobre que \u00e9 poss\u00edvel ir e retornar \u00e0 terra ap\u00f3s uma luta mortal com lobos. Assim, ela decide viver em ambos os mundos. \u201cPara ter seguran\u00e7a na velhice, eu vou mirar em alcan\u00e7ar 80.000 moedas de ouro!\u201d \u201cTentarei n\u00e3o deixar coisas estranhas circularem para n\u00e3o distorcer o progresso do mundo, mas n\u00e3o vou me conter pelo bem da minha vida f\u00e1cil e segura!\u201d Enquanto usa tr\u00eas pistolas junto com palavras e a\u00e7\u00f5es que parecem decentes, em sua cabe\u00e7a Yamano Mitsuha \u00e9 uma garota esperta. Fazendo um esfor\u00e7o para ganhar dinheiro mesmo com um pequeno corpo que parece uma crian\u00e7a para os ocidentais!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"101715","ap":"saving-80000-gold-in-another-world-for-my-retirement","bl":"60007902","bw":"series\/139071","kt":"40881","mu":"7mul6q7","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B07M6S66D9","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/431305\/","mal":"111466","raw":"https:\/\/yanmaga.jp\/comics\/\u8001\u5f8c\u306b\u5099\u3048\u3066\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u3067\uff18\u4e07\u679a\u306e\u91d1\u8ca8\u3092\u8caf\u3081\u307e\u3059","engtl":"https:\/\/kmanga.kodansha.com\/title\/10048\/episode\/314459"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2017,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"36fd93ea-e8b8-445e-b836-358f02b3d33d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Monsters"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relation